Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Power of Everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 59
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.97,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Weslie back to us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s opening a portal again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think my world is a place you can just enter whenever you please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Weslie back right now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can do it, then give it a try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, Weslie, wake up, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it’s you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The core of the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So after being absorbed, you have to wait here for the conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw a lot of people here who had been completely turned into energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we need to find a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the state we’re in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, there’s nothing you can do either
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you are just playing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve discovered that energies can influence each other
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we try to disrupt his energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So he can’t absorb it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But what good would that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe my friends are still out there fighting hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I, right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,must also fight alongside them in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Weslie back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the Absorption Device remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it will provide me with a ceaseless supply of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My energy…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see what he can do without any energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Still couldn’t make it out in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been here for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re about to turn into energy ourselves now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But we’ve decided to channel our remaining energy to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, you sacrificed yourselves to save me…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The result
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet I didn’t manage to do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We never would have made it this far
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, we have a different kind of life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who can create miracles
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you have abilities again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t your gadget break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What I’m using now is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone’s power
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, it is impossible to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie has become so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let Weslie fight alone. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My gear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wolffy I know isn’t someone who gets discouraged easily
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy has set off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie, you stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to help Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, that…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been thinking lately
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn’t made you clear out your inventions back then…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I understood you a little better…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was thanks to you confiscating my gadgets
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that I was able to use the boomerang bomb to stop Blue’s scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to use the gadgets you brought to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,hurry and come help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for my triumphant return, Wolnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off in one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous. These attacks are nothing more than a tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Size Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me, King Wolffy, give you a good
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to taste what it’s like to be pulled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back our worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way you can defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,am this very world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like he has an endless supply of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth can we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His energy comes from the Absorption Device in the core layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just open the passage to the core layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we can destroy the Absorption Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome the arrival of my world with your destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Made it just in time.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
